      "created_at": "2014-04-29T09:39:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m sure this has been asked before, and a lot,  but I’m wondering what is the best way to play as a 2 player co-op?  I’m new to the game and playing as 2 hero’s each is a little much right now. I’m thinking reducing the villains hp in half might help. Is there a set way and/or rules for a 2 player game?</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>",
