      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/b77776/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-29T12:59:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I play 2 players with 1 person overseeing the Villain and Environment decks and playing 1 hero and the 2nd person playing 2 heros.&nbsp; For just starting out, I suggest using complexity 1 heros like Legacy, Tempest, Wraith or RA.</p>",
